# Local-only Claude Code artifacts
.claude/agent-memory/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Dependencies and local env files
**/*/node_modules
**/*/.env

# Build output
**/dist/

# Test coverage output
**/coverage/

# macOS
**/.DS_Store

# Stray root-level ChromaDB store — the app reads backend/chroma_db/ (already
# gitignored via backend/.gitignore); this root copy is local scratch only.
/chroma_db/

# Local full-dataset archive — not used by the build (code reads backend/data/).
# Copy region files from here into backend/data/ when expanding coverage.
/data/

# Personal working notes — not for the public repo.
/docs/delivery-log.md
/docs/next-steps.md
/docs/onsen-guide-bot-delivery-plan.md
/docs/eval-report.md
/docs/templates

# Superseded V2/V3/ask-mode plan docs — kept locally for reference, not in the public repo.
/docs/archive/